{"id":"vod_sn_36413","vodId":"36413","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"TARI TARI","name_cn":"TARI TARI","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/65cb642a43f7d67869da499ffc53c88b.jpg"},"summary":"曾经热爱唱歌的坂井和奏（高桓彩阳 配音）在母亲去世后就此紧闭了双唇，愧疚和悔恨一直折磨着她脆弱的灵魂，这也导致本来在年音乐特长班的她转到了普通班。一次偶然中，和奏认识了同班同学宫本来夏（瀬户麻沙美 配音），来夏对音乐的热爱感染了和奏，也唤起了她对于音乐久违的热情。冲田妙羽（早见沙织 配音）的出现彻底奠定了和奏重拾音乐的决心，合唱部应运而生。　　随着维也纳转学生前田敦博（花江夏树 配音）的出现，合唱部的人气达到了顶峰，有了音乐的每一天，和奏都和伙伴们快乐的渡过着，母亲坂井真昼（大原沙耶香 配音）给和奏带来的困扰也逐渐的转化为了生活的动力。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rTbKx1H29C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dS8vZsrnUm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0AMip1UdXe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pikeSBfPJe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1iFTxjG4xX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EzhxKCvQ631/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cDejSuj8My1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2VBrc8Ej1N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f4p3HaA6aU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CVZfcGAdt71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JAj3nQPiwy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8VMpsJJLZd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0w1wpUKM541/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:23.617Z"}